{"seq":1,"at":"2026-09-17","kind":"imported","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0054"},"reason":"Article of the Quiztopia bank (written for card c005): researched and transcribed in September 2026, converted to the quiz platform on 2026-10-20.","by":"Quiztopia import","ref":"quiz-archive/transcripts/quiztopia/c005.json"},
{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0054"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge society/society","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/society__society.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",46],["-","five"],["+","six"],["=",5],["-","five"],["+","six"],["=",639],["+","Education, finally, has a quieter champion. In the OECD's comparisons of educational attainment, Canada has for years had the highest share of adults with a tertiary degree of any member country, and the OECD's 2022 report still put it first in the world: more than 57 per cent of Canadian adults hold at least a college or university qualification. Its many two-year community colleges, which count as tertiary education, explain part of the lead, and so does an immigration system that favours graduates. By this measure Canada is often called the most educated country in the world.\n\n"],["=",127],["+","\n| Highest share of tertiary-educated adults (OECD) | Canada | more than 57 % (2022 report) |"],["=",99],["-","five."],["+","six."]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",40],["-","fünf"],["+","sechs"],["=",3],["-","fünf"],["+","sechs"],["=",605],["+","Die Bildung schließlich hat einen stilleren Spitzenreiter. In den Bildungsvergleichen der OECD hat Kanada seit Jahren unter allen Mitgliedsländern den höchsten Anteil an Erwachsenen mit Hochschulabschluss, und auch der OECD-Bericht von 2022 sah das Land weltweit vorn: Mehr als 57 Prozent der kanadischen Erwachsenen haben mindestens einen College- oder Universitätsabschluss. Die vielen zweijährigen Community Colleges, die zum tertiären Bereich zählen, erklären einen Teil des Vorsprungs, ebenso eine Einwanderungspolitik, die Akademiker bevorzugt. Nach diesem Maßstab gilt Kanada oft als das gebildetste Land der Welt.\n\n"],["=",123],["+","\n| Höchster Anteil an Erwachsenen mit Hochschulabschluss (OECD) | Kanada | mehr als 57 % (Bericht 2022) |"],["=",97],["-","fünf."],["+","sechs."]]},{"field":"notesEn","old":"","new":"The education ranking counts the share of adults (25–64) with tertiary education in OECD member countries; such rankings can change from report to report."},{"field":"notesDe","old":"","new":"Die Bildungsrangliste zählt den Anteil der Erwachsenen (25–64 Jahre) mit tertiärem Abschluss in den OECD-Mitgliedsländern; solche Ranglisten können sich von Bericht zu Bericht ändern."}]},
